 <pre><code>curl -X DELETE "https://ipv64.net/api/v2/cdn64o/tunnels/tn_DEINE_TUNNEL_ID" -H "Authorization: Bearer DEIN_API_KEY"</code></pre>
 <div class="callout warn"><div class="callout-title">Protect the token</div><p>With the tunnel token a node can log in to the edge servers as your tunnel. Do not share it. If it has leaked, issue a new one.</p></div>
 
